:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Ken (Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''Ken''' is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy that appears in the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 8.10 Update#Update 8.10.5|Version 8.10.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Ken
|image = E 486.png
|first appearance = [[Rush & Blaze (Easy)]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
Ken has very high health and attack power along with an [[Omni Strike]] and a 100% chance to [[Knockback]] all Cat Units, although along with his multi-hit, this can make some of his attacks miss due to both factors.

==Strategy==
[[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red cats]] such as [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Islands]] can easily counter him along with meatshieds, in levels where he is protected you could use Long Range units like [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Red Riding Mina]] or ubers like [[EVA Unit-02 (Uber Rare Cat)|EVA Unit-02]].

